B.ast=new A.bs("taraf_02",B.eQ,"Kabul nedir?",B.ad3,1,"HMK m. 308: Kabul, davac\u0131n\u0131n talep sonucuna daval\u0131n\u0131n k\u0131smen veya tamamen muvafakat etmesidir.")
B.ahC=s(["Evet, her ikisi de kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n kabul\xfcne ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r.","Hay\u0131r; feragat ve kabul tek tarafl\u0131 irade beyan\u0131yla sonu\xe7 do\u011furur, kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n veya mahkemenin muvafakatine gerek yoktur.","Yaln\u0131zca h\xe2kimin onay\u0131yla ge\xe7erli olur.","Yaln\u0131zca noter huzurunda yap\u0131l\u0131rsa ge\xe7erlidir."],t.s)
B.as7=new A.bs("taraf_03",B.eQ,"Feragat ve kabul\xfcn ge\xe7erlili\u011fi i\xe7in kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n veya mahkemenin onay\u0131 gerekir mi?",B.ahC,1,"HMK m. 309/1: Feragat ve kabul, dilek\xe7eyle veya yarg\u0131lama s\u0131ras\u0131nda s\xf6zl\xfc olarak yap\u0131l\u0131r; kar\u015f\u0131 taraf\u0131n ya da mahkemenin muvafakatine ba\u011fl\u0131 de\u011fildir (tek tarafl\u0131 i\u015flemlerdir).")
